<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#exemplarOf> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n    :my-item a frbr:Item ;\n        frbr:exemplarOf :my-manifestation .\n\n    :my-manifestation a frbr:Manifestation .\n    " .
